; Count out 9 balls in AUTO
; E.S.R.'s way: A = 128 - 9, OVERFLOW set to HALT, AUTO, and START once.
; The 9th ball carries out of A7 and drops into OVERFLOW's pocket instead of
; reaching the trip lever: the machine stops by itself, nine balls out.

R               ; reset: COUNT on, OVERFLOW RUN, MANUAL
SET A 9
X Space X Space ; complement it: A = 119 = 128 - 9
OVERFLOW HALT   ; the shutter open: a carry out of A7 drops into the pocket
AUTO            ; the thread hooked into the START lever
RUN             ; START once: nine balls, by themselves
CHECK A 0
MANUAL
OVERFLOW RUN
